# How to Run

Open the terminal in the project folder and run any program using:

```bash
python 1_atm_simulation.py
```

```bash
python 2_student_grade_calculator.py
```

```bash
python 3_reverse_guessing_game.py
```

```bash
python 4_guessing_game_hints.py
```

```bash
python 5_combined_application.py
```

